  "all_posts": [
    {
      "id": 665575,
      "name": "Ashish Yadav",
      "username": "Yashish3101",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/yashish3101/{size}/111468_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-08-18T14:21:59.755Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/subendu\">@Subendu</a></p>\n<p>Dear sir,</p>\n<p>I am a student doing this degree as a secondary degree being enrolled in 4 courses this term and considering that I am in my 4th year in my primary degree it gets very hectic most of the time and therefore I solely rely on mail for notifications and deadlines. I could not attempt BPT 1 as there was no notification on mail and had missed it. I also missed BPT3 because of my own poor management. And thus the average for my first 3 BPTs is just 33% contrary to the required minimum 40% required for the eligibility of OPPE.</p>\n<p>I sincerely request you consider my BPT4 as well for the eligibility and allow me to attempt the OPPE and I will try my best to never repeat this again.</p>\n<p>I deeply apologize for the inconvenience I have caused.</p>\n<p>Regards,</p>\n<p>Ashish</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
